For APDs and TCEs, there is no such thing as an “admin only user.” That applies to DPEs. By policy, any APD or TCE can perform certain administrative functions and complete administrative preapprovals at any time. This functionality should apply to every APD and TCE, regardless of authorization. 

As we mentioned, submission of administrative preapprovals has increased over time, making the requirement for the MS to approve each preapproval to become an unnecessary burden.
